omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qsrULKkOppMQ7kNvwHkPWgP&_nc_oc=Adrk5mWQEF-nzlMaTyynAStMmb_1bPd8XbcZqdCogVMN_sWvYN4t760PcCuKrd6gITM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af68fSJNtBEkqdVfv9jl79orEe2fTkxLd-7925NlZFCsug&oe=6A09DD34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kWrEpw2co3UQ7kNvwH7h9eo&_nc_oc=Ado9-vjfvRhf3u1S0ZtMmBQZFZxoDxM2h8gXVMExTwWt-8GXhWttYbsnAscBo2Fe73M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7BhWsvbXXLKfanP1vWinxsZKICdc5EZ-cG91E7yAAlUg&oe=6A09DE96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cIjk4VocAVkQ7kNvwEXboPG&_nc_oc=AdqfZ3KwHVUOZX2WlREYWKQSOBCTk93CAF_VeTaz4yGDj1fQPpGTeKKHiN1t4utaMwA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af68lox0Wa8C7Nipp5S8TbX-LFWm_UT-juPhXgdA2u7ApA&oe=6A09BB77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://